      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Here's another draft:\n\n\"Our client's travel experience was disrupted by a luggage issue that affected thousands of passengers across multiple hubs. We're partnering with the airline to clarify the cause of this problem and implement steps to prevent it from happening again in the future. We're committed to delivering on our promise of convenience and reliability, and our teams are working diligently to ensure all affected passengers receive the assistance they need, including reimbursement and rebooking as required.\"\n\nThis version maintains a more formal tone while still conveying empathy and commitment to resolving the issue. The expansion on working to resolve the problem adds a sense of proactive action, while the language used is carefully crafted to avoid admitting fault or liability.",
      "source": "target",
